msgid "Object Avoidance"
msgstr "避障"

#: ../../source/docs/common-object-avoidance-landing-page.rst:7
#: ecd7250591fa405ca5266e937c481a45
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports several kinds of object avoidance. Avoidance of Airborne "
"Vehicles (ADSB) and Object Avoidance (Object/Ground/Ceiling)."
msgstr "ArduPilot 支持多种避障方式：空中飞行器规避（ADSB）和物体避障（物体/地面/天花板）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-object-avoidance-landing-page.rst:9
#: 279d364bde5d4bc3822c9d8a74f5ead8
msgid ""
"Supported types vary with vehicle (Plane only supports ADSB). Some kinds of "
"avoidance require external hardware, such as ADSB receivers or  "
"Rangefinders."
msgstr "支持的类型因飞行器而异（固定翼仅支持 ADSB）。某些避障类型需要外部硬件，例如 ADSB 接收机或测距仪。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-object-avoidance-landing-page.rst:12
#: 0a5df361963247e1b72dda7da4ac3905
msgid "Avoidance Strategies"
msgstr "规避策略"

#: ../../source/docs/common-object-avoidance-landing-page.rst:14
#: e72b5f4eb3bd41d9a706f05c44e1aba3
msgid ""
"Various strategies are employed and vary depending on vehicle, mode, and/or "
"object to be avoided. Re-routing, slide, stop, or failsafe style actions are"
" the most common ones. See the particular Avoidance Feature below for "
"details."
msgstr "根据飞行器、模式和/或需规避的物体，采用不同策略。重新路由、滑移、停止或失控保护式动作是最常见的。详情请参阅以下各避障功能说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-object-avoidance-landing-page.rst:19
